### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Register user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/identity/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "anika.rao@example.com",
  "displayName": "Anika Rao",
  "department": "Finance",
  "jobTitle": "Controller"
}

### Activate user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/identity/users/REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "reason": "HR onboarding completed"
}

### Register credential reference
POST http://localhost:8080/api/identity/credentials
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID",
  "credentialType": "SSO_SUBJECT",
  "credentialReference": "okta|00u12345",
  "mfaEnabled": true
}

### Create application
POST http://localhost:8080/api/identity/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicationCode": "ERP",
  "displayName": "Enterprise Resource Planning",
  "ownerTeam": "enterprise-platform",
  "defaultRoles": ["VIEWER", "APPROVER"]
}

### Grant application access
POST http://localhost:8080/api/identity/access-grants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID",
  "applicationId": "REPLACE_WITH_APPLICATION_ID",
  "roleName": "APPROVER",
  "grantedBy": "iam-admin"
}

### Revoke application access
POST http://localhost:8080/api/identity/access-grants/revoke
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accessId": "REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_ID",
  "revokedBy": "iam-admin",
  "reason": "Role no longer required"
}

### Query users
GET http://localhost:8080/api/identity/users

### Query applications
GET http://localhost:8080/api/identity/applications

### Query access summaries
GET http://localhost:8080/api/identity/access-summaries

### Query tracked consumed events
GET http://localhost:8080/api/identity/tracked-events
